<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45502/helm-of-the-faceless">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_138.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of the Faceless</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46175/conquerors-aegis-faceguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_97.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Aegis Faceguard</span></a> are very similar helmets. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46175/conquerors-aegis-faceguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_97.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Aegis Faceguard</span></a> ends up easier to slot into most sets, giving you an avenue to access your set bonuses as well as having substantially more defense.<br/>
<br/>It's important to remember that meta gems such as <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41380/austere-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Austere Earthsiege Diamond</span></a> requires a <span class="gem2">red</span> and two <span class="gem8">blue</span> gems to activate. A <span class="gem10">purple</span> gem will count towards both <span class="gem2">red</span> and <span class="gem8">blue</span> requirement when utilized with this meta gem.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a> if you have <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
