<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>All options in this slot for phase 2 are linear upgrades from each other and from phase 1. That is to say that they're all virtually identical just get incrementally better until you get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45496/titanskin-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Titanskin Cloak</span></a> which is your best in slot.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47672/enchant-cloak-mighty-armor">
