<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46039/breastplate-of-the-timeless">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breastplate of the Timeless</span></a> is the best chest for you in phase 2, however due to restrictions around tier set bonuses, you may want to opt for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46173/conquerors-aegis-breastplate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Aegis Breastplate</span></a>. Essentially this slot will determine which helmet you decide to pick up and we advise you to, at least initially use a first come first serve discretion.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise this slot doesn't allow you much creative control, there are very few chests in phase 2, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45334/unbreakable-chestguard">
