<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45988/greaves-of-the-iron-army">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of the Iron Army</span></a> is a hefty piece, while a little lacking in strong avoidance it offers a substantial addition of expertise and pulls ahead in EHP over its counterparts. It's from a hardmode which means you may not see these for a while, though when you do get them they are easy to slot into most sets.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45560/spiked-deathdealers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiked Deathdealers</span></a> being a BoE crafted makes these quite lucrative, allowing you to bypass all RNG to get these ASAP. On top of that, they're very strong and are competitive with any of the boots that we can get in phase 2.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45166/charred-saronite-greaves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Charred Saronite Greaves</span></a> stands as your prime hit option in your feet slot, however since we are not short on strong hit alternatives already these mostly serve the purpose of giving you a diversity of option while still gearing.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45542/greaves-of-the-stonewarder">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of the Stonewarder</span></a> are really high in SBV and doesn't offer much else, kind of a stepping stone item that you can wear while still acquiring other pieces, this does have good anti physical properties.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: The unique properties of <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> lends itself extremely well to tanks, and it's recommended to keep multiple sets of boots with this and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44528/enchant-boots-greater-fortitude">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Greater Fortitude</span></a>. If you don't have <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44528/enchant-boots-greater-fortitude">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Greater Fortitude</span></a> stands as the best option with the exception of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> when you're not specced into <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=26023/pursuit-of-justice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persuitofjustice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pursuit of Justice</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
