<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45471/fates-clutch">
