<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45112/the-leviathans-coil">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Leviathan's Coil</span></a> is a solid jack of all trades ring that while lacking the explicit direction of some other rings this is easily slotted for most sets.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45326/platinum-band-of-the-aesir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_50naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Platinum Band of the Aesir</span></a> pairs really well with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45471/fates-clutch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fate's Clutch</span></a> for a high expertise setup.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45871/seal-of-ulduar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_misc_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Ulduar</span></a> is just a better version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45874/signet-of-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Winter</span></a> and neither of these have any defense, making them more difficult to equip, especially during your gearing process. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45871/seal-of-ulduar">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_misc_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of Ulduar</span></a> is solid however as it presents you with the 2nd highest EHP out of any tanking ring in phase 2.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45534/seal-of-the-betrayed-king">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_76.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Betrayed King</span></a> bears mentioning though we don't expect any protection paladin to actually need or acquire this for quite some time, though with the right setup this is a very powerful threat slot in, however you do not need this at any point in phase 2.<br/>
<br/>
