<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46097/caress-of-insanity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caress of Insanity</span></a> is the highest performing weapon in Phase 2 for us in a vacuum, however since it is so highly contested and only narrowly superior to the alternatives we recommend that you focus efforts on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45947/serilas-blood-blade-of-invar-one-arm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Serilas, Blood Blade of Invar One-Arm</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The alternative is that if you rolled a <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_dwarf_female.gif");'></span> you will have access to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59224/mace-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a>, making all of the good mace alternatives equal to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45947/serilas-blood-blade-of-invar-one-arm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Serilas, Blood Blade of Invar One-Arm</span></a>. In turn giving you a higher degree of choice and less competition for your weapon upgrades. For dwarves we recommend that you get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45463/vulmir-the-northern-tempest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vulmir, the Northern Tempest</span></a> so that you can pass on the swords for potential DPS or other tanks, at least initially as this will really help out your raids gearing process.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45959/furious-gladiators-truncheon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Furious Gladiator's Truncheon</span></a> and other PvP weapons are special in that it will require a massive PvP investment from you to acquire. These are slated to require <b>2200 Rating</b> to purchase, which we don't consider to be all too realistic for the majority of players out there. However if you are going to get this, know that the real utility of the weapon (beside having a weapon and not competing for a PvE drop) is that the additional resilience on this, will come crucial if you want to wear more than 2 OS/<wbr/>DPS pieces such as belt &amp; ring later down the line.<br/>
<br/>Lastly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45442/sorthalis-hammer-of-the-watchers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sorthalis, Hammer of the Watchers</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45876/shiver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_90.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shiver</span></a> bears mention, they're both hardmode weapons and are strictly worse than most options from Ulduar, fast weapons with parry are unfortunately just way too weak compared to slow weapons with agility. The only real saving grace of this is that they have a significant stamina pool and it's less contested than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40402/last-laugh">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Last Laugh</span></a> was last phase, however note that some DPS might still want these as a middle of the road upgrade to their BiS though much less likely to be contested.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64579/enchant-weapon-blood-draining">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_note_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Blood Draining</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59619/enchant-weapon-accuracy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Accuracy</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=27984/enchant-weapon-mongoose">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Mongoose</span></a> &gt; <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41976/titanium-weapon-chain">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Titanium Weapon Chain</span></a>
