<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shields">Shields for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 2</h3>Both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45587/bulwark-of-algalon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bulwark of Algalon</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45877/the-boreal-guard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Boreal Guard</span></a> are roughly of equal performance and both are unfortunately locked behind high demand content. We recommend that you don't fret over your shield too much, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45450/northern-barrier">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Northern Barrier</span></a> is a solid option for those with few prospects to farm hardmode encounters.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise 10-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=3456/naxxramas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Naxxramas</span></a> (as well as 25man) and 10-man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> will give you access to a myriad of functional shields if you're still in the need to catch up or prepare for phase 2.<br/>
